WEBVTT

00:23:29.329 --> 00:23:33.079
and you were scoring each trade
once you had completed

00:23:33.288 --> 00:23:34.829
the questions about that trade

00:23:35.204 --> 00:23:37.621
jumping in here, because this
is such a cool example,

00:23:37.621 --> 00:23:38.829
but it needs a little explaining.

00:23:39.496 --> 00:23:42.246
Danny created a system for interviewers
to rate job candidates

00:23:42.246 --> 00:23:46.496
on specific traits like work ethic,
analytical ability or integrity.

00:23:47.246 --> 00:23:49.163
But interviewers did not take it well.

00:23:49.829 --> 00:23:51.871
They really hated the system.

00:23:52.996 --> 00:23:55.704
When I introduced it and they
they told me I mean,

00:23:55.704 --> 00:24:00.538
I vividly remember one of them saying,
you're turning us into robots.